|                                                                                   |
|  +---------------------------+   +-----------------------+   +-----------------+  |
|  |     TANPURA QUAD DRONE    |   |    BĀNSURĪ LEAD SYNTH |   | TEENTAAL TABLA  |  |
|  | Pa (196Hz) - Sa - Sa - Sa |   | 22-Shruti Pure Ratios |   | 16-Beat Cycles  |  |
